Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onKeyPress(phases:action:)":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onKeyPress","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"phases","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV","text":"KeyPress","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV6PhasesV","text":"Phases","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"action","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV","text":"KeyPress","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV","text":"KeyPress","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV6ResultO","text":"Result","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/onkeypre